    feat(assert): add fail-fast guards for DP/TP, GFPO relations, and per-shard batch feasibility\n\n- GRPOConfig: assert mesh/device compatibility and per-host batch divisibility.\n- GFPOConfig: assert num_return_sequences == gfpo_group_size and retain < group.\n- BaseTrainer: assert steps_per_epoch>0 for training given per-shard base length.\n- Update progress.txt with assertion summary.

diff --git a/easydel/trainers/base_trainer.py b/easydel/trainers/base_trainer.py
